OL,3,GNEWSAPost Office resumes deliveries to 
OL,4,A'most' of the EU                       
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man Post Office (IOMPO) has
OL,7,Fresumed sending goods to most of the   
OL,8,FEuropean Union after suspending the    
OL,9,Fservice for three weeks.               
OL,11,FCustomers are still not able to send   
OL,12,Fparcels to Germany, Denmark or         
OL,13,FLuxembourg, however, because of issues 
OL,14,Fsurrounding how customs duties are paid
OL,15,Fin those countries.                    
OL,17,FBusinesses will also have to wait      
OL,18,Flonger for the service to return, with 
OL,19,Fno resumption date having yet been     
OL,20,Fprovided.                              
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
