OL,3,GNEWSAPost Office resumes deliveries to 
OL,4,A'most' of the EU                       
OL,6,FAn IOMPO spokesperson said: "We        
OL,7,Fapologise for the disruption           
OL,8,Fexperienced while EU goods services    
OL,9,Fwere unavailable."                     
